        ['Can you check a video without uploading it?', 'That is the default here. The MP4/MOV container is parsed locally through Rust compiled to WebAssembly, and frame extraction, when needed, also runs on your machine via ffmpeg.wasm.'],
        ['Does a video downloaded from social media still work?', 'Sometimes a file name or a stray field survives, but platforms usually re-encode uploads and strip the metadata. A result with no hits cannot rule out AI generation.'],
